id: pm-8txeqe
title: Offer compact metadata-only configuration discovery for recovery and package authoring
description: "Configuration inventory currently includes current values alongside keys and validation metadata. Recovery and package authors usually need names, aliases, paths, kinds and constraints. Provide a supported metadata-only discovery projection that avoids carrying unrelated configured values into agent context while preserving explicit value-query compatibility."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 3
tags: []
created_at: "2026-11-09T11:50:40.305Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-09T11:55:36.073Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: Provide CLI SDK and MCP discovery parity; cover project/global consent scope and complete declared aliases/paths; exclude synthetic credential and large-value canaries from metadata-only output; preserve explicit get/export value semantics and truthful budget receipts; route recovery through the compact discovery path
parent: pm-8jdc
risk: medium
confidence: 90
expected_result: Agents and package authors can discover scoped configuration keys and constraints without receiving unrelated configured values.
